    "title": "<p>Differential diagnosis for EBV-positive mucocutaneous ulcer (EBVMCU)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Alejandro Gru",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 703.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"938\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>EBVMCU</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CHL</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>EBV+ DLBCL</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>LyG</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>LyP</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Clinical presentation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ulcers without associated mass or systemic symptoms</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphadenopathy</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lymphadenopathy, extranodal mass; visceral disease; systemic symptoms</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Respiratory symptoms, cutaneous manifestations, CNS / renal involvement</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Small papules, nodules with spontaneous resolution</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Immune suppression&nbsp;/ dysregulation</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">(common with age-related immune senescence)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">(age-related immune senescence)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Site</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Oral, anorectal mucosa; GI tract</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Variable; skin very rare</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Variable; skin rare</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lung, skin, CNS, kidneys</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Skin of different sites</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>EBV status</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Cytology</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Medium to large cells with HRS-like appearance; rich inflammatory background</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">HRS and HRS-like cells; rich inflammatory background</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Sheets of large lymphoma cells with HRS-like morphology; geographical necrosis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Medium to large cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Medium to large cells (including hallmark-like cells)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Angiotropism</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">++</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">(with necrosis)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">(++ in subtype&nbsp;E)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>IHC profile</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD20+, CD30+, PAX5+ (often strong), OCT2+, BOB1+, CD45+, PDL1 (CD274)&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD20&minus;, PAX5+ (dim), CD30+, CD15+, CD45&minus;, PDL1 (CD274)+, OCT2&minus;, BOB1&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD20+, CD79a+, IRF4&nbsp;(MUM1)+, CD30+, CD45+, PDL1 (CD274) + in young (65%) but rare in older patients</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD20+, CD79a+, CD30+, EBER (grading), PDL1 (CD274)&nbsp;NA</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD3+, CD30+, CD15&minus;/+, other T-cell antigens, EBV&minus;, PDL1 (CD274)&nbsp;NA</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"109\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Prognosis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Excellent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Variable, good</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Very poor</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Variable (poor in high-grade lesions)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 124.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"166\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Excellent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CHL, classic Hodgkin lymphoma; EBER, EBV-encoded small RNA; EBV+ DLBCL, EBV-positive diffuse large B-cell lymphoma; GI, gastrointestinal; IHC, immunohistochemistry; LyG, lymphomatoid granulomatosis; LyP, lymphomatoid papulosis; NA, not available.</p>",
